      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON LORENZ (5) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (30.65) in a Grade 5 at The Meadows. Solid record at the distance winning three races. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with two wins from four starts. Has ability and is a key runner. PERFECT PICTURE (4) finds it hard to break through. Filled a minor placings again last time when third (29.75) at Sandown making it three placings in a row. Overdue and gets her chance. INDIAN STAR (1) could manage only seventh at Sandown last time but impressed when posting a solid 27.20 over 485m at this track the start prior. Expecting another bold showing. EXACTLY LIKE DAD (2) cannot be ruled out.",
